## What I Did

Neural scene reconstruction training was too slow for rapid iteration, so we implemented signed distance functions with Taichi and Instant-NGP, profiling bottlenecks. We achieved roughly 3× reduction in training time and I presented the research at the Wetterhahn Research Symposium.


## What I Learned

Ask questions. Research (much like the design process) is a cycle of curiosity, implementation, and reflection.
